  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maintaining Access and Quality of Essential M/XDR?TB Management Interventions - Azerbaijan (01-Jan-2016-31-Dec-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Azerbaijan, Tuberculosis, Ministry of Health of the Republic of Azerbaijan (MOH Azerbaijan)This program has the following goals: To reduce the socio-economic burden of TB in Azerbaijan through significant decline in TB (including drug-resistant TB) incidence, prevalence, and mortality. The objectives of this program are: Enable and promote research and innovation.  Ensure integrated, patient-centred care and prevention.  Pursue bold policies and supportive systems</narrative>
  </description>
